      "writtenOn": "2024-11-27T03:41:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The use of \"combined\" throughout this CL is confusing, since there is also \"soongMetricsFile\", and that\u0027s not combined.  This seems to be specifically aggregated file metrics, but doesn\u0027t combine any other Soong metrics.",
