      "writtenOn": "2024-11-27T18:07:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As I understand it, the intent is to migrate some of the other metrics in this direction (soong ui has a proto that includes the \"located-elsewhere, more specific\" protobuf, instead of the other place needing to depend on the proto definition in ui/metrics.)\n\nOne outstanding question (waiting to hear from @joeo@google.com) is whether to add the combined metrics into `soongMetricsFile`, or leave them as a separate file.",
      "parentUuid": "dbac4694_ae4bc5c8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 216,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 216,
        "endChar": 26
      },
