      "writtenOn": "2024-12-05T00:03:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After discussion, I\u0027ve renamed it to \"ExecutionMetrics\" (metrics gathered during the execution of ninja, or whatever replaces it), rather than \"CombinedMetrics\".  We expect to *add* more metrics to this proto, but none of the existing metrics fit the model of \"metrics about individual build action execution gathered during the execution.\"",
